      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "name": "UseBaseUn",
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "库存单位标志Y/N。官方发料窗口说明：Y时行Quantity按库存单位发出，Items per Unit为1；N时实际库存数量按行Quantity和NumPerMsr换算。结合本行历史unitMsr及NumPerMsr解释单位，不能只因Quantity=InvQty就推定。",
